7-Day Study Plan (July 11 – July 17)

Given your existing experience with PySpark, AWS Glue, Lambda orchestration, and Lake Formation, you have a strong foundation. Here's an optimized plan:

Day 1 (July 11) – Domain 1: Data Ingestion (Part 1)

    Kinesis Data Streams vs. Firehose vs. Analytics — when to use which
    AWS DMS — full load vs. CDC, source/target configurations
    AppFlow for SaaS integrations
    Batch vs. real-time ingestion patterns
