Day 3 (July 13) – Domain 2: Data Store Management (Part 1)

    S3 — storage classes, lifecycle policies, versioning, replication
    Redshift — distribution styles, sort keys, COPY command, Spectrum, concurrency scaling
    Data modeling — star schema, denormalization for analytics
    Practice: 15 questions on data stores

Day 4 (July 14) – Domain 2: Data Store Management (Part 2)

    DynamoDB — partition keys, GSI/LSI, streams, capacity modes
    RDS/Aurora — read replicas, Multi-AZ, Aurora Serverless
