    Data lake architecture patterns (raw → curated → consumption)
    Practice: 15 questions on data stores

Day 5 (July 15) – Domain 3: Data Operations & Support

    MWAA (Managed Airflow) — DAGs, scheduling, sensors
    Step Functions — orchestrating Glue/Lambda/EMR workflows
